  "question": {
    "text": "Let for a differentiable function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2890",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Now, taking <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></math></p><p>Now, using <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>·</mo><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>41</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2870</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2890</mn></math></p>",
